docs {
  # GET /quizzes
  
  Retrieves quizzes under a topic (with quiz settings meta).
  
  ## HTTP Method & Route
  - **Method:** `GET`
  - **Route:** `/wp-json/tutor/v1/quizzes`
  
  ## Authentication
  - **Requires** Bearer JWT (always authenticated).
  - User must be able to view the parent course.
  - Permission from the bound API key: `Read`, `Read/Write`, or `All`.
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
  | `topic_id` | `integer` | **Yes** | Parent topic post ID. Required REST arg; omitting it typically yields `rest_missing_callback_param`. |
  
  ## Responses
  
  ### 200 OK (Success)
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_quiz",
    "message": "Quiz retrieved successfully",
    "data": [
      {
        "ID": 501,
        "post_title": "Module 1 Knowledge Check",
        "post_content": "Short evaluation of module 1 concepts.",
        "post_name": "module-1-knowledge-check",
        "quiz_settings": [
          {
            "time_limit": {
              "time_value": "30",
              "time_type": "minutes"
            },
            "attempts_allowed": "3",
            "passing_grade": "80",
            "max_questions_for_answer": "10"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  Each item is a public post DTO (`ID`, `post_title`, `post_content`, `post_name`) plus `quiz_settings` from `get_post_meta(..., 'tutor_quiz_option', false)` (array of settings objects).
  
  ### 404 Not Found
  ```json
  {
    "code": "tutor_read_quiz",
    "message": "Quiz not found for given ID",
    "data": {
      "status": 404
    }
  }
  ```
}
